
' Swimlane activity (runbooks, DAG task flow, decision trees). Start from preambles/house.puml +
' this file. One lane per role or system (`|Lane|`), lanes are columns; every decision says
' Yes / No on its branches; start and stop are explicit. Lines are drawn with elbows by the
' activity engine itself (linetype does not apply).

title Activity diagram for <runbook or flow> (as-of date)

|Replace: role A|
start
:Replace: first step;
|Replace: role B|
:Replace: second step;
if (Replace: check?) then (Yes)
  :Replace: step on Yes;
else (No)
  |Replace: role A|
  :Replace: step on No;
  stop
endif
|Replace: role B|
:Replace: last step;
stop

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | column | one role or system |
  | rounded box | step |
  | hexagon | decision, branches Yes / No |
  | circle / ringed dot | start / stop |
endlegend
@enduml
